<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Oklahoma copiers and printers backed by Summit Technology Affiliates. Explore equipment, flexible leasing, automated supplies, local service, and connected document workflows.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#BF2026">
<title>Oklahoma Copiers & Printers | Summit Technology Affiliates</title>
<!-- STANDALONE FILE: all CSS, icons, and images are embedded. No frameworks, font CDNs, or external asset files required.
EDITING GUIDE:
1. Set FORM... URL in the configuration script at the bottom to your Formlets EMBED URL.
2. Adjust .assessment-frame height in the style block to fit your actual form.
3. Search section ids: assessment, print-solutions, support, document-lifecycle, about, faq, more-solutions.
4. Product buttons link to the current Summit product pages. Replace links as needed.
5. Embedded images retain their original content; display crops are controlled with CSS.
6. FAQ dropdowns use accessible buttons and inline JavaScript. Solution cards are full-card clickable links.
Image notes: hero uses a previously generated Summit campaign image, not a photograph documenting actual employees.
Product images supplied by summitaffiliates.com; STA main logo from the user-supplied brand master.
OKC skyline by Urbanative, CC BY-SA 3.0; visible credit below the About section. No endorsement implied.
-->
<style>
:root{--red:#BF2026;--red-dark:#98191e;--ink:#252b30;--muted:#5f666d;--silver:#f1f3f4;--line:#dfe3e6;--white:#fff;--radius:7px;--page:1200px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:24px}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--white);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,input,select{font:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--red);outline-offset:5px}
.wrap{width:min(var(--page),calc(100% - 64px));margin-inline:auto}
.skip{position:fixed;top:8px;left:8px;transform:translateY(-180%);padding:10px 16px;background:#fff;color:var(--red);z-index:20}.skip:focus{transform:none}
h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}
h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.17;letter-spacing:-.035em}
h1{font-size:clamp(34px,3.65vw,52px);font-weight:800;max-width:660px}
h2{font-size:clamp(27px,2.5vw,36px);font-weight:750}
h3{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:var(--red);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:13px}.eyebrow::after{content:"";width:40px;height:2px;background:currentColor}
.btn{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:46px;padding:11px 23px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:5px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;text-align:center;transition:background .18s,transform .18s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--red-dark);border-color:var(--red-dark);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-small{min-height:41px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:13px}
.text-link{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;color:var(--red);font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.text-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.site-header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding-block:22px}
.brand{flex:0 1 260px}.brand img{width:260px}
.header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.phone{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.hero{padding:44px 0 39px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.42fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:43px;align-items:start}
.hero-intro{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;max-width:590px;margin-top:15px}
.hero-cta{margin-top:22px}
.hero-photo{margin:26px 0 0;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:var(--silver)}
.hero-photo img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.85;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}
.assessment-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:4px solid var(--red);border-radius:5px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 9px 28px #20252a07;overflow:hidden;scroll-margin-top:25px}
.assessment-header{padding:25px 26px 0}.assessment-header h2{font-size:25px}.assessment-header p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px}
.assessment-frame{display:block;width:100%;height:390px;border:0;background:#fff}
.assessment-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:0 18px 20px}
.trust-band{background:var(--silver);border-top:1px solid #e9ecee;border-bottom:1px solid #e9ecee}
.trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding-block:20px}
.trust-item{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:13px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 20px}.trust-item+.trust-item{border-left:1px solid #cfd5d9}
.icon{width:34px;height:34px;flex:0 0 34px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.section{padding-block:48px}
.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:25px}.section-heading p{max-width:470px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-top:10px}
.product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.product{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;transition:border-color .18s,box-shadow .18s,transform .18s}
.product:hover{border-color:var(--red);box-shadow:0 5px 16px #22272c0b;transform:translateY(-3px)}
.product-image{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:145px;padding:14px;background:#fff}.product-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}
.product-label{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:12px 11px;background:#f5f6f7;border-top:1px solid #edf0f2;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;flex:1}.product-label span:last-child{color:var(--red);font-size:20px;line-height:1}
.manufacturers{background:var(--silver);padding:13px 0}.manufacturer-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:0}.manufacturer-row span{padding:0 32px;color:#535c62;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.manufacturer-row span+span{border-left:1px solid #cfd5d9}
.support-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}
.support-card{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:17px;background:#f5f6f7;border:1px solid #edf0f2;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px 20px}
.support-card .icon{width:41px;height:41px;flex-basis:41px;color:var(--red)}
.support-card h3{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:-.015em}.support-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted)}
.coverage{font-size:12px;color:#727a80;margin-top:15px;text-align:center}
.lifecycle-section{background:#fafbfb;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.lifecycle-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:30px}.lifecycle-heading p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.lifecycle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:0;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:#fff;overflow:hidden}
.lifecycle-step{position:relative;padding:25px 22px 24px}.lifecycle-step+.lifecycle-step{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.stage-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px}.stage-number{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;width:33px;height:33px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.stage-arrow{color:#a7b0b6;font-size:24px}.lifecycle-step:last-child .stage-arrow{visibility:hidden}
.lifecycle-step h3{font-size:19px;min-height:45px;margin-bottom:12px}.lifecycle-step p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px}.lifecycle-step .text-link{font-size:12px}
.lifecycle-tail{margin-top:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}.lifecycle-tail strong{color:var(--red);font-size:15px}.lifecycle-tail span{color:var(--muted)}
.about{position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:#e9edef;overflow:hidden}
.about-bg{position:absolute;z-index:-1;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}.about::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffffff0a,#ffffff1c 46%,#ffffff40);z-index:-1}
.about-inner{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding-block:48px}.about-panel{width:48%;background:#fffffff5;padding:30px 33px;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid #ffffffdd;box-shadow:0 10px 40px #1d2b3810}
.about-panel h2{font-size:30px}.about-panel p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#535b62;margin-top:15px}.about-panel .text-link{margin-top:18px}
.photo-credit{background:#fff;font-size:10px;color:#7a8288;text-align:right;padding:6px 0}.photo-credit a{text-decoration:underline}
.faq-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:55px}.assessment-explanation{border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding-right:45px}.assessment-explanation h2,.faq h2{font-size:26px}.assessment-explanation p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-top:15px}.assessment-explanation .text-link{margin-top:19px}
.faq h2{margin-bottom:17px}.faq details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:8px;background:#fff}.faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:12px 15px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5}.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq summary::after{content:"+";font-size:20px;font-weight:400;color:var(--red)}.faq details[open] summary::after{content:"−"}.faq details[open] summary{border-bottom:1px solid #eceff1}.faq details p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);padding:13px 15px 17px;line-height:1.65}
.final-cta{background:#30383e;color:#fff;padding:31px 0}.final-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:26px}.final-inner h2{font-size:27px}.final-inner p{color:#d1d7db;font-size:14px;margin-top:7px}
footer{padding:24px 0}.footer-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.footer-inner address{font-style:normal}.footer-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}.footer-links a:hover{color:var(--red)}
@media(min-width:1600px){.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.85}}
@media(max-width:1050px){.hero-grid{gap:28px;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr}.wrap{width:calc(100% - 44px)}.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.4}.product-grid{gap:9px}.product-image{height:115px;padding:10px}.product-label{font-size:11px;padding:10px 8px}.support-card{padding:20px 15px;gap:12px}.support-card .icon{width:32px;height:32px;flex-basis:32px}.lifecycle-step{padding:23px 16px}.about-panel{width:54%}}
@media(max-width:780px){.hero{padding-top:30px}.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.hero-copy h1{max-width:570px}.hero-intro{max-width:600px}.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.8}.assessment-frame{height:350px}.trust-item{font-size:12px;padding-inline:10px;gap:8px}.trust-item .icon{width:26px;height:26px;flex-basis:26px}.product-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.product-image{height:145px;padding:15px}.product-label{font-size:13px;padding:12px}.support-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.section-heading{align-items:start}.lifecycle-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:15px}.lifecycle-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.lifecycle-step:nth-child(3){border-left:0}.lifecycle-step:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.lifecycle-step h3{min-height:0}.lifecycle-tail{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.about-panel{width:64%;padding:26px}.about-inner{padding-block:40px}.faq-grid{gap:28px}.assessment-explanation{padding-right:25px}.final-inner h2{font-size:24px}.footer-inner{flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:center;text-align:center}}
@media(max-width:540px){.wrap{width:calc(100% - 36px)}.header-inner{padding-block:17px;gap:15px}.brand{flex-basis:180px}.brand img{width:180px}.header-actions{gap:0}.header-actions .phone{display:none}.btn-small{font-size:11px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:38px}.hero{padding-bottom:27px}.hero-intro{font-size:17px}.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.4;object-position:center top}.btn{font-size:13px;padding-inline:18px}.assessment-header{padding:23px 22px 0}.assessment-header h2{font-size:24px}.trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:5px}.trust-item{font-size:13px;justify-content:flex-start;padding:11px 14px}.trust-item+.trust-item{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #dce1e4}.section{padding-block:34px}.section-heading{display:block;margin-bottom:20px}.section-heading .text-link{margin-top:12px}.product-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.product-image{height:145px}.product-label{font-size:12px}.manufacturer-row{flex-wrap:wrap}.manufacturer-row span{padding:0 15px;font-size:12px}.support-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.support-card{padding:21px 18px;gap:16px}.support-card .icon{width:37px;height:37px;flex-basis:37px}.support-card h3{font-size:17px}.lifecycle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lifecycle-step+.lifecycle-step{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.lifecycle-step{padding:23px}.stage-top{margin-bottom:14px}.stage-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg)}.lifecycle-step h3{font-size:21px}.lifecycle-step p{margin-bottom:12px}.about-inner{padding-top:145px;padding-bottom:24px}.about-bg{object-position:36% top}.about-panel{width:100%;padding:25px}.about-panel h2{font-size:27px}.photo-credit{font-size:9px;text-align:center}.faq-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}.assessment-explanation{border-right:0;padding-right:0}.final-inner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px}.final-inner .btn{width:100%}.footer-links{gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{transition:none!important}}
@media print{.site-header,.final-cta,.skip{display:none}.wrap{width:100%}.section{padding-block:20px}.assessment-card{break-inside:avoid}.assessment-frame{height:200px}.support-card,.lifecycle-step{break-inside:avoid}a{color:inherit}.about{print-color-adjust:exact}}

/* REVISED HERO, DROPDOWNS, AND FULL-CARD SOLUTION LINKS */
.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.44fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;gap:42px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,3.25vw,47px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--red)}
.hero-category{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;color:#525c64;margin-bottom:12px}
.hero-eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.085em;margin-bottom:18px}
.hero-intro{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:18px;max-width:625px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:19px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:21px}
.hero-actions .hero-cta{margin-top:0}
.hero-secondary{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)}.hero-secondary:hover{color:var(--red)}
.hero-photo{margin-top:26px;border:1px solid #e3e7ea;border-bottom:3px solid var(--red);border-radius:7px;background:white}
.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.55;object-position:center top;object-fit:cover}
.hero-photo figcaption{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:12px 16px;background:#f6f7f8;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.025em}.hero-photo figcaption span:nth-child(even){color:var(--red)}
.faq-item{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:9px;overflow:hidden;background:white}.faq-item h3{margin:0;letter-spacing:0}
.faq-toggle{border:0;background:white;color:var(--ink);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px;width:100%;padding:14px 16px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5}
.faq-toggle:hover{background:#f6f7f8}.faq-toggle span{color:var(--red);font-size:20px;font-weight:400;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1}
.faq-toggle[aria-expanded="true"]{color:var(--red);border-bottom:1px solid #e9edef;background:#fafbfb}
.faq-answer[hidden]{display:none}.faq-answer p{padding:15px 16px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)}
.more-solutions{background:var(--silver);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:46px 54px}
.solution-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:23px}
.solution-card{border:1px solid #d9dfe3;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.solution-card:hover{border-color:var(--red);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 14px 28px #25323e12}
.solution-image{aspect-ratio:1.6;overflow:hidden;background:#e7ecef}.solution-image img{height:100%;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;transition:transform .3s}
.solution-card:hover .solution-image img{transform:scale(1.025)}
.solution-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;padding:25px 25px 23px;border-top:3px solid var(--red)}
.solution-kicker{font-size:10px!important;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)!important;margin:0 0 10px!important}
.solution-body h3{font-size:25px;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2}
.solution-body>p:not(.solution-kicker){font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:23px}
.solution-link{margin-top:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red)}.solution-link span{font-size:22px}
@media(max-width:1050px){.hero-grid{gap:30px}.hero h1{font-size:38px}.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.4}.solution-grid{gap:16px}.solution-body{padding:22px 19px}.solution-body h3{font-size:23px}}
@media(max-width:780px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}.hero h1{font-size:44px;max-width:690px}.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.55}.solution-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.solution-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 60%}.solution-image{aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:250px}.solution-body{border-top:0;border-left:3px solid var(--red);padding:24px}.solution-body h3 br{display:none}}
@media(max-width:540px){.hero h1{font-size:36px}.hero-eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.06em}.hero-category{font-size:13px}.hero-intro{font-size:16px}.hero-actions{gap:14px}.hero-photo img{aspect-ratio:1.3}.hero-photo figcaption{font-size:10px;padding-inline:12px;gap:6px}.more-solutions{padding-block:34px}.solution-card{display:flex}.solution-image{aspect-ratio:1.6;min-height:0}.solution-body{border-top:3px solid var(--red);border-left:0;padding:25px}.solution-body h3{font-size:25px}}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<!-- Inline symbol set: decorative icons only; brand marks are authentic image assets. -->
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;overflow:hidden">
<defs>
<symbol id="pin" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M26 13c0 8-10 16-10 16S6 21 6 13a10 10 0 1 1 20 0Z"/><circle cx="16" cy="13" r="3.5"/></symbol>
<symbol id="people" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><circle cx="16" cy="9" r="4"/><path d="M8 27v-5a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v5Z"/><path d="M7 5a4 4 0 0 0 0 8M25 5a4 4 0 0 1 0 8M4 17a6 6 0 0 0-2 5v4h3M28 17a6 6 0 0 1 2 5v4h-3"/></symbol>
<symbol id="handshake" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m2 14 6-9 7 3 5-2 10 8-6 9-4 4-4-2-3-1-3-4-5-2Z"/><path d="m15 8-5 6 4 2 5-4 7 7M19 20l4 3M15 23l4 3M2 14l3 4M30 14l-4 5"/></symbol>
<symbol id="lease" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M7 2h12l6 6v21H7Z"/><path d="M19 2v7h6M11 13h10M11 17h6"/><path d="M19 20v8M22 21h-4a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-4"/></symbol>
<symbol id="supplies" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M9 10V3h14v7M8 24H3V10h26v9M10 16h3"/><path d="m13 22 7-4 9 4-9 5-7-5v7l7 4 9-4v-7M20 27v6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="wrench" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M26 3a8 8 0 0 0-10 10L3 26a2 2 0 0 0 3 3l13-13A8 8 0 0 0 29 6l-5 5-5-5 7-3Z"/><circle cx="6" cy="26" r=".6"/></symbol>
<symbol id="message" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M3 4h26v18H12l-7 6v-6H3Z"/><path d="M8 10h16M8 15h11"/></symbol>
<symbol id="response" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="12"/><path d="M16 8v8l6 3M23 2l5 4M4 6l5-4"/></symbol>
<symbol id="workflow" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><rect x="2" y="3" width="10" height="9" rx="1"/><rect x="20" y="20" width="10" height="9" rx="1"/><path d="M12 7h12v9M21 13l3 3 3-3M20 25H8v-9M5 19l3-3 3 3"/></symbol>
</defs></svg>
<header class="site-header">
<div class="wrap header-inner">
<a class="brand" href="https://summitaffiliates.com/" aria-label="Summit Technology Affiliates homepage"><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="1352" height="331" alt="Summit Technology Affiliates"></a>
<div class="header-actions"><a class="phone" href="tel:+14059470707">(405) 947-0707</a><a class="btn btn-small" href="#assessment">Free Assessment</a></div>
</div>
</header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">Family-Owned and Locally Focused since 1987</p>
<p class="hero-category">Oklahoma Copiers &amp; Printers</p>
<h1 id="hero-title">One partner for your<br><span>entire document journey.</span></h1>
<p class="hero-intro">Creating it. Printing it. Mailing it. Finding it again. Summit connects the full lifecycle of your documents—with the right equipment, practical automation, and a local team there every step of the way.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn hero-cta" href="#assessment">Let’s Connect Your Workflow <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="hero-secondary" href="#document-lifecycle">See the full document lifecycle <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
<figure class="hero-photo"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1920" height="1920" alt="Illustrative scene of a business customer reviewing printed documents with a service technician beside an office copier" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption><span>Generate</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Print</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Mail</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Retrieve</span></figcaption></figure>
</div>
<aside class="assessment-card" id="assessment" aria-labelledby="form-heading">
<div class="assessment-header"><h2 id="form-heading">Tell us what you need</h2><p>Let’s find the right equipment and support.</p></div>
<!-- FORMLETS IFRAME PLACEHOLDER: set FORMLETS_EMBED_URL in the script below. The srcdoc is a visual placeholder, not a live form. -->
<iframe class="assessment-frame" id="formlets-frame" title="Free assessment — Formlets form placeholder" srcdoc="&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;&lt;style&gt;
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:white;color:#252b30;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:24px 26px}main{border:1px dashed #cbd1d6;border-radius:5px;min-height:315px;background:#f8f9fa;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:26px;text-align:center}.icon{height:46px;width:46px;border:1px solid #dfe3e6;border-radius:9px;background:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:20px;color:#bf2026;margin-bottom:17px}.tag{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;color:#bf2026;margin:0 0 10px}h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 11px}p{font-size:13px;color:#666f76;line-height:1.65;margin:0;max-width:275px}small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#788189;margin-top:20px}code{font-family:monospace;background:#e9edf0;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:500px){body{padding:20px 22px}main{min-height:290px}}
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;main&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;FORMLETS EMBED&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your assessment form goes here&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is an iframe placeholder. Add your Formlets embed URL in the page configuration to display your live form.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;small&gt;Configuration: &lt;code&gt;FORMLETS_EMBED_URL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;No information is collected here.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/main&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;"></iframe>
<p class="assessment-note">Free assessment. No obligation.</p>
</aside>
</div>
</section>
<section class="trust-band" aria-label="Local service benefits">
<div class="wrap trust-grid">
<div class="trust-item"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pin"/></svg>Oklahoma-based team</div>
<div class="trust-item"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#people"/></svg>Local personalized support</div>
<div class="trust-item"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#handshake"/></svg>Flexible leasing</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="print-solutions" aria-labelledby="products-heading">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Find the right fit</p><h2 id="products-heading">Explore Our Print Solutions</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="https://summitaffiliates.com/product-pages/view-all/all-products.html">View all products <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
<div class="product-grid">
<a class="product" href="https://summitaffiliates.com/product-pages/print/office-mfps.html"><div class="product-image"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Toshiba floor-standing office multifunction copier" loading="lazy"></div><div class="product-label"><span>Office Copiers</span><span aria-hidden="true">›</span></div></a>
