<li class="lifecycle-step"><div class="stage-top"><span class="stage-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><h3>Create, Capture<br>&amp; Print</h3><p>Print, copy, scan, and produce professional documents with equipment matched to your workload—including directly printed envelopes.</p><a class="text-link" href="#print-solutions">Print &amp; capture solutions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
<li class="lifecycle-step"><div class="stage-top"><span class="stage-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><h3>Prepare &amp;<br>Mail</h3><p>Fold, insert, seal, and apply postage. Simplify outgoing mail preparation and coordinate physical and digital communications.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://summitaffiliates.com/product-pages/mailing/mail-machines.html">Mailing solutions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
<li class="lifecycle-step"><div class="stage-top"><span class="stage-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></div><h3>Store, Find<br>&amp; Retrieve</h3><p>Archive documents digitally with searchable records and accessible history, helping your team find the information it needs.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://summitaffiliates.com/product-pages/solutions/document-archive-retrieval.html">Archive &amp; retrieval <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
</ol>
<div class="lifecycle-tail"><strong>One partner. Your whole document journey.</strong><span>Let’s look at the workflow—not just the machine.</span></div>
</div>
